                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "369bcb8e-d4ae-321a-944b-f83b91c5c086",
                        "entry_id": "3b1a387d-24f3-3d7b-96e0-bfe1228bd2f3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "dealings, intercourse"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e7eff11-23b3-4408-ab27-77d75acac8c5",
                                "sense_id": "369bcb8e-d4ae-321a-944b-f83b91c5c086",
                                "text": "Сноше́ния с Литво́ю! э́то что?..\nПроти́вен мне род Пу́шкиных мяте́жный,\nА Шу́йскому не до́лжно доверя́ть.\nУкло́нчивый, но сме́лый и лука́вый…",
                                "translation": "Contacts with Lithuania! meaning what?…\nThese rebellious Pushkins are offensive to me,\nAnd Shuisky also isn’t to be trusted:\nHe’s elusive, but bold and devious…",
                                "english": "Contacts with Lithuania! meaning what?…\nThese rebellious Pushkins are offensive to me,\nAnd Shuisky also isn’t to be trusted:\nHe’s elusive, but bold and devious…"
                            }
                        ]
